WEBVTT

00:00.007 --> 00:01.175
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION. UNDERAGE
DRINKING IS STRONGLY PROHIBITED.

00:01.175 --> 00:02.468
FORCEFUL ALCOHOL CONSUMPTION, BINGE
DRINKING, SHAMEFUL ACTS NOT ENCOURAGED.

00:02.468 --> 00:03.761
VIEW THIS AS A COMEDY. ALL CHARACTERS
APPEARING IN THIS WORK ARE OF LEGAL AGE.

00:03.761 --> 00:04.970
DUE TO RECENT COMPLIANCE ISSUES, THE
BLACK DOT SIZE HAS BEEN INCREASED BY 5%.

00:16.106 --> 00:18.567
Let's go take a trip
under the bright summer sun

00:18.567 --> 00:21.779
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 3
To a city far away, what do you say?

00:21.779 --> 00:24.198
Let's go take a trip
under the bright summer sun

00:24.198 --> 00:27.743
To a city far away, what do you say?

00:31.830 --> 00:33.707
Wait a sec, another heatwave?

00:33.707 --> 00:35.417
Temperatures are rising... Huh?!

00:35.417 --> 00:38.629
Our original plans are
totally busted, what now?

00:38.629 --> 00:41.465
But honestly, I'm getting so hyped

00:41.465 --> 00:44.134
Alright, let's roll up
our sleeves and dive in

00:44.134 --> 00:45.886
Rub your sleepy eyes and jump up

00:45.886 --> 00:47.346
Grab the usual shades

00:47.346 --> 00:50.266
Check your gear: Iced coffee, thermos

00:50.266 --> 00:52.935
Clear blue skies, just a trick of summer

00:52.935 --> 00:56.063
The booming speakers
keep calling my name

00:56.397 --> 00:58.899
Even now, I still believe

01:01.819 --> 01:03.779
In unexpected encounters

01:03.779 --> 01:06.365
And the miracles of this season

01:06.365 --> 01:09.618
Summer brings
those swing swing emotions

01:09.618 --> 01:12.371
Ah, even if I get a little carried away

01:12.371 --> 01:17.585
On my mind,
I've only been searching for you

01:17.585 --> 01:23.507
Let the south wind blow you here,
just as you are

01:23.507 --> 01:28.220
Under the blue sky, hold me tight

01:29.054 --> 01:34.476
I want to dream
a summer dream with you

01:34.977 --> 01:38.439
KITAHARA INN

01:45.613 --> 01:46.905
So delicious!

01:46.989 --> 01:48.866
It really is tasty, Shiori-chan.

01:48.866 --> 01:50.576
Thank you everyone.

01:50.576 --> 01:53.329
But I didn't actually cook this.

01:53.579 --> 01:56.624
Has Kitahara been eating this well
since he was a kid?

01:56.624 --> 01:57.916
Lucky bastard.

01:57.916 --> 01:59.293
Don't talk nonsense.

01:59.460 --> 02:02.671
All I ever got were leftovers
on the verge of expiring.

02:02.671 --> 02:05.758
I'm so sick of stuff like
dried-up raw sashimi.

02:05.924 --> 02:07.134
Makes sense.

02:07.509 --> 02:11.597
When I was little, Big Brother
would cook for me as well.

02:11.889 --> 02:13.932
Because our parents were so busy.

02:13.932 --> 02:15.100
Really?

02:15.225 --> 02:18.479
But when she grew up a bit,
she's responsible for the meals.

02:18.604 --> 02:20.814
Big Brother, it's time for lunch.

02:20.814 --> 02:22.608
Knock first, will you!

02:23.067 --> 02:24.777
I see...

02:24.985 --> 02:27.154
Cooked by your own little sister, huh?

02:27.154 --> 02:29.573
So annoying.
Stop emitting that murderous aura.

02:29.823 --> 02:32.534
Then on the way back,
just ask her to make us bentos.

02:32.534 --> 02:34.328
Is that okay, Shiori-chan?

02:34.328 --> 02:35.079
Yes.

02:35.079 --> 02:36.246
That's no big deal.

02:36.246 --> 02:38.374
Big Sister Chisa, do you want one too?

02:38.666 --> 02:40.918
- Is that okay?
- Of course.

02:41.460 --> 02:43.379
Sorry to bother you.

02:43.504 --> 02:45.214
Your big bro is so touched...

02:45.214 --> 02:47.716
Not at all, it's no bother.

02:48.050 --> 02:50.135
On the contrary, I'm actually happy.

02:50.135 --> 02:51.387
Happy?

02:51.804 --> 02:52.888
Yes.

02:52.971 --> 02:54.807
After resting at the inn,

02:55.057 --> 02:57.601
everyone heading home on the train
all cheerful...

02:57.935 --> 03:00.896
Big Sister Chisa holding the rice ball
I made in her hand.

03:01.146 --> 03:05.275
Imamura-senpai holding the
rolled omelet I made in his hand.

03:05.275 --> 03:06.527
Huh, what of your brother, me?

03:06.735 --> 03:11.448
My brother is smiling, holding
the passport I made in his hand.

03:12.074 --> 03:15.327
Just thinking about it brings my mood up.

03:15.327 --> 03:18.038
- Shiori-chan!
- What a good girl.

03:18.080 --> 03:20.958
Did you just say
you
made
my passport?

03:21.834 --> 03:24.878
Come to think of it,
you are wearing a
yukata
too.

03:24.878 --> 03:25.796
Yes.

03:25.796 --> 03:28.006
I'm done helping out for today,

03:28.006 --> 03:31.635
if I keep wearing my
kimono
,
people will think I'm still working.

03:31.844 --> 03:32.928
I see.

03:32.928 --> 03:36.098
It's true that wearing a
yukata
makes you more like a guest.

03:36.098 --> 03:39.017
The
yukata
really suits you, Shiori-chan.

03:39.017 --> 03:40.394
Yeah, it's very cute.

03:40.394 --> 03:41.895
Thank you.

03:42.020 --> 03:42.980
Huh?

03:43.105 --> 03:45.357
What do you think?

03:45.607 --> 03:46.734
Hmm...

03:47.025 --> 03:50.070
It really does suit her and looks great.

03:50.279 --> 03:54.116
But to provoke those two,
it's still lacking a little something.

03:54.700 --> 03:56.744
This brat has zero sex appeal.

03:57.077 --> 04:00.956
Big brother, staring at me like that...

04:01.123 --> 04:02.708
is totally creeping me out.

04:03.208 --> 04:04.835
Ah, sorry.

04:04.960 --> 04:08.297
I didn't mean to look at you like that.

04:08.589 --> 04:09.715
Really?

04:09.882 --> 04:11.967
First, take off one layer.

04:12.134 --> 04:13.218
What?

04:13.218 --> 04:15.387
And pull the collar down a bit more.

04:15.387 --> 04:18.223
What the hell are you
telling your own sister to do?

04:18.223 --> 04:18.974
Huh?

04:19.224 --> 04:21.393
It's a normal thing between siblings.

04:23.479 --> 04:25.022
By the way, Big Brother.

04:25.022 --> 04:26.398
- Hmm?
- What?

04:26.648 --> 04:30.986
If you guys are planning to
stand guard in my room tonight,

04:30.986 --> 04:33.906
where should I sleep
so I'm not in the way?

04:34.072 --> 04:35.657
Ah, about that...

04:35.657 --> 04:38.076
Sleep on the same futon
as your Big Bro Kouhei!

04:39.161 --> 04:41.538
Do you hate staying with us that much?

04:41.705 --> 04:43.457
Yes, I'd rather die.

04:44.166 --> 04:46.960
But if it's
just
you,
you're always welcome.

04:47.795 --> 04:50.214
Then how about
sleeping in Chisa's room?

04:50.339 --> 04:54.593
I don't mind either way, but
I'm afraid of bothering Big Sister Chisa.

04:54.676 --> 04:56.011
It's fine.

04:56.345 --> 04:57.387
But why?

04:57.638 --> 05:00.808
We heard there's a stalker following
her, so we're a bit worried.

05:01.058 --> 05:03.435
Come to think of it,
the police were here today.

05:03.727 --> 05:04.728
Exactly.

05:04.728 --> 05:06.647
It's absolutely unforgivable!

05:06.939 --> 05:09.358
Then just sleep in my room tonight, okay?

05:09.358 --> 05:11.026
Thank you so much.

05:11.151 --> 05:12.277
Let's roll with that.

05:12.277 --> 05:14.530
We don't know what might happen.

05:16.073 --> 05:20.160
Of course, we will also
do our best to protect you.

05:20.160 --> 05:22.412
You are my beloved
little sister after all.

05:22.704 --> 05:24.373
Thank you both very much.

05:24.373 --> 05:27.000
She's not your sister though,
Imamura-kun.

05:27.459 --> 05:29.837
If everything goes smoothly,
return my passport...

05:29.837 --> 05:30.796
Excuse me.

05:30.796 --> 05:31.296
Huh?

05:32.798 --> 05:35.425
Sorry about earlier today.

05:35.592 --> 05:38.345
Please accept this drink as an apology.

05:38.887 --> 05:40.305
Oh no, it's nothing.

05:40.305 --> 05:42.516
You don't need to worry about it.

05:42.516 --> 05:44.184
Please, go ahead and drink.

05:44.184 --> 05:45.394
Um...

05:45.561 --> 05:46.687
Thank you.

05:46.812 --> 05:50.107
By the way, where are the other two?
Aren't you together?

05:50.107 --> 05:53.110
Yes, they went back to their room earlier.

05:53.277 --> 05:57.406
Those two appear to be doing
something behind my back.

05:58.907 --> 06:01.618
They took photos but wouldn't let me see.

06:01.618 --> 06:04.746
They kept whispering
while looking at a map.

06:05.622 --> 06:06.623
What do you think?

06:06.623 --> 06:09.459
There's no doubt about it.

06:09.626 --> 06:11.920
Do you know where their room is?

06:12.129 --> 06:15.173
Then they're probably in
the Matsu Room.

06:18.260 --> 06:20.137
- The Matsu Room?
- Got it.

06:20.971 --> 06:23.265
Are they now friends with each other?

06:23.557 --> 06:25.684
I don't think so.

06:25.684 --> 06:28.395
I have a bad feeling about
what's going to happen.

06:28.812 --> 06:31.398
If you don't mind, please have a seat.

06:31.690 --> 06:32.900
Is that okay?

06:33.150 --> 06:36.486
Yes, don't mind them.

06:36.778 --> 06:39.114
Thank you very much.

06:39.239 --> 06:42.951
I'd love to chat about Japanese culture.

06:43.660 --> 06:45.078
Is that so?

06:45.287 --> 06:47.247
MATSU ROOM

06:50.751 --> 06:51.543
Yes?

06:54.546 --> 06:56.673
Good evening.

06:56.673 --> 06:59.051
We are from the police.

07:07.517 --> 07:09.853
- Totally reeks of crime in here.
- Yeah.

07:09.853 --> 07:12.397
What's most suspicious is
that nothing looks off.

07:12.397 --> 07:14.524
Pretty wild how we thought
the exact opposite

07:14.524 --> 07:16.234
but reached the same conclusion.

07:16.902 --> 07:18.695
Anyway, that's how it is.

07:18.695 --> 07:21.657
You two, stay put in this room tonight.

07:27.704 --> 07:28.705
Kugel!

07:28.705 --> 07:29.289
Stroh!

07:29.957 --> 07:32.626
Aren't you the boys from this morning?

07:32.834 --> 07:35.170
Do you want to compete with us that badly?

07:35.712 --> 07:38.256
Come to think of it,
I almost forgot, Kouhei.

07:38.256 --> 07:40.092
That's right, Kitahara.

07:41.218 --> 07:44.846
I don't think having a high alcohol
tolerance is anything to brag about.

07:45.055 --> 07:48.058
But we are members of PaB after all.

07:48.684 --> 07:51.812
How can we let them
keep looking down on us!

07:54.856 --> 07:56.817
What fearless little runts.

07:57.067 --> 08:00.237
Chugging water after a few weak drinks.

08:00.487 --> 08:02.698
Meanwhile, what we drink every day

08:02.698 --> 08:04.658
is already 35% alcohol.

08:04.658 --> 08:07.744
This might be a bit
too hardcore for you kids.

08:08.078 --> 08:11.373
For us, it's just an appetizing starter.

08:11.707 --> 08:14.876
Well, our opponents are
lightweight Japanese guys anyway.

08:14.960 --> 08:18.005
It's just that we, the Crazy
Uwabami
,
are way too god-tier.

08:18.338 --> 08:21.717
If anything, we could even go easy
on you and mix in some tonic...

08:21.717 --> 08:22.467
Hey!

08:22.467 --> 08:23.468
Hah?

08:23.719 --> 08:27.764
EASY TRANSLATE
When we drink off, can we use chasers?

08:30.767 --> 08:34.146
Aren't you embarrassed of
having to drink water?

08:34.479 --> 08:38.025
Has the Japanese
Yamato
spirit
vanished into the 2D world?!

08:38.108 --> 08:40.193
Alright, alright.

08:40.193 --> 08:42.237
Let's do it with chasers.

08:42.487 --> 08:43.739
Cheers then!

08:43.739 --> 08:44.990
Cheers!

08:45.490 --> 08:46.658
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

08:52.164 --> 08:53.665
Tapping out already?

08:54.166 --> 08:57.127
Gotta hand it to you
for surviving one glass!

08:57.544 --> 09:00.630
Guess we won't hold back
with our chaser now.

09:01.131 --> 09:04.676
Even watered down, you guys
don't stand an ounce a chance.

09:07.471 --> 09:08.638
What the hell is this!?

09:08.638 --> 09:11.349
It's too strong... This isn't water!

09:11.933 --> 09:14.269
You call this a chaser?!

09:14.269 --> 09:15.771
You gotta be shitting me!

09:16.897 --> 09:20.067
The liquor is too sweet,
I can't get used to it.

09:20.067 --> 09:22.110
The flavor's a bit too punchy.

09:22.319 --> 09:25.655
So what have you guys
been grumbling about?

09:25.697 --> 09:28.575
Could it be you
misunderstood something?

09:28.825 --> 09:30.911
That's a real shame.

09:31.203 --> 09:34.206
The reason we can't drink it
is because it's too sweet,

09:34.206 --> 09:35.791
not because of alcohol.

09:35.791 --> 09:38.835
For us, this is the real beverage.

09:38.835 --> 09:41.338
And that is just a chaser.

09:44.466 --> 09:45.467
Nice.

09:45.467 --> 09:47.969
This way, Shiori-chan
won't be in danger anymore.

09:48.386 --> 09:52.182
But I didn't expect them to be
so obsessed with anime characters.

09:52.182 --> 09:54.518
That's some admirable passion.

09:54.726 --> 09:58.146
They even traveled all the way
to Japan with their club mates.

09:58.146 --> 10:00.857
Yeah, they are all people
with the same interest...

10:01.817 --> 10:02.901
What is it?

10:02.901 --> 10:05.445
Ah no, I just realized something.

10:05.445 --> 10:06.321
What?

10:06.488 --> 10:10.659
These guys are all club mates,
so they are into the same thing, right?

10:10.659 --> 10:11.701
That's right.

10:11.827 --> 10:13.245
If so...

10:13.328 --> 10:16.581
then that Karina is the same, isn't she?

10:18.625 --> 10:21.128
So what kind of things
are you interested in?

10:21.211 --> 10:24.297
You can ask me anything
as long as I know about it.

10:24.464 --> 10:26.049
Thank you.

10:26.383 --> 10:29.511
Then I won't hold back.

10:30.137 --> 10:33.557
I want to learn about
Japan's
hentai
culture.

10:33.557 --> 10:36.017
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 3

10:36.017 --> 10:38.979
KITAHARA INN

10:42.607 --> 10:44.943
Hentai
culture?

10:45.777 --> 10:47.904
I don't mean anything weird.

10:47.988 --> 10:50.824
I am researching Hokusai's
Shunga
.

10:51.616 --> 10:54.578
Ah, you mean Hokusai Katsushika?

10:54.578 --> 10:57.164
I heard he's also very famous overseas.

10:57.289 --> 11:00.750
I'm not really an expert on that,
so I probably can't help much.

11:00.917 --> 11:03.044
Sorry, me neither.

11:03.044 --> 11:04.713
It's fine.

11:05.005 --> 11:09.426
What I want to ask you two about is
everyday culture.

11:10.093 --> 11:12.220
Like the Japanese way of life?

11:12.220 --> 11:14.389
If so, then I can probably help.

11:14.639 --> 11:17.017
Yes, for example...

11:17.017 --> 11:17.601
KIRARA YOIMACHI

11:17.601 --> 11:19.936
SOFT RELAXING SHAMPOO
how to bathe in a hot spring.

11:20.478 --> 11:22.230
MATSU ROOM

11:22.230 --> 11:23.273
So drunk...

11:23.273 --> 11:25.400
Are you saying she's just like them?

11:25.692 --> 11:27.027
Exactly.

11:27.277 --> 11:28.320
Hmm...

11:28.653 --> 11:32.073
Can't believe a classy beauty like her
is in the same boat as those guys.

11:32.324 --> 11:33.366
Unbelievable.

11:33.450 --> 11:36.995
But otherwise, there's zero reason
she'd be hanging with them.

11:37.204 --> 11:41.416
True, hanging out with these guys
is practically a punishment game.

11:41.917 --> 11:45.754
Come to think of it, the peeping tom
back then had a rather slender build.

11:45.921 --> 11:46.796
Really?

11:47.047 --> 11:51.676
Hey you two, tell me about
that Karina woman.

11:52.761 --> 11:54.054
Good morning...

11:54.054 --> 11:55.305
Hello...

11:55.305 --> 11:57.349
Kouhei, turn on the translation app.

11:57.349 --> 11:58.642
Understood.

11:59.309 --> 12:01.519
We have something to ask.

12:01.937 --> 12:04.147
We have a question for you.

12:04.356 --> 12:06.816
Tell us everything about that Karina lady.

12:07.275 --> 12:09.778
I am very interested in Karina.

12:10.195 --> 12:11.196
What!?

12:11.279 --> 12:13.907
What does she like about Japan?

12:14.115 --> 12:17.077
What does she think of Japanese man?

12:17.077 --> 12:17.911
Oh!

12:17.911 --> 12:19.037
Love is wonderful!

12:19.204 --> 12:21.498
Are Shiori and Chisa in any danger?

12:21.790 --> 12:24.918
Can she get along with my family?

12:24.918 --> 12:26.336
Of course!

12:26.336 --> 12:27.573
Marry her already!

12:30.298 --> 12:34.010
They said they would support
an international marriage between students.

12:34.010 --> 12:36.471
Who asked about that!?

12:36.680 --> 12:40.016
Ask what she plans to do
with Shiori and Chisa!

12:40.517 --> 12:43.687
What does Karina plan to do
with the girls from earlier?

12:44.187 --> 12:45.605
The girls from earlier?

12:45.855 --> 12:48.108
He means the two who look like Kirara?

12:48.483 --> 12:51.695
Because she loves Kirara in
Blue Spring
...

12:51.778 --> 12:53.238
Is she planning to experience

12:53.238 --> 12:56.366
the game world in real life
with Shiori and Chisa?

12:56.616 --> 12:58.827
Could it be he doesn't know
about
Blue Spring
?

12:59.077 --> 13:02.330
How could he possibly live
with Karina like that?

13:03.039 --> 13:04.291
What are they saying?

13:04.958 --> 13:08.169
Not sure, the app didn't catch everything.

13:08.628 --> 13:12.590
But is she really that obsessed?

13:13.800 --> 13:16.011
Don't you understand?

13:16.177 --> 13:17.178
Understand what?

13:17.178 --> 13:21.766
Experiencing a dating sim world in
real life is the dream of all mankind.

13:22.017 --> 13:24.477
Meeting someone
who resembles a game character,

13:24.477 --> 13:27.188
it's only natural to expect
a similar scenario!

13:27.564 --> 13:28.898
BREAK THE CURSE - KISS HER
That scene too...

13:28.940 --> 13:31.693
BECOME MY VERY OWN KINDERGARTNER!
That's the scene I've always dreamed of!

13:36.323 --> 13:38.616
You guys feel me right, fellow brethren?

13:38.616 --> 13:39.617
Of course!

13:39.617 --> 13:40.660
Thank you!

13:40.827 --> 13:42.412
Are they really that similar?

13:42.537 --> 13:45.999
If I met Lalako, I'd be the same!

13:45.999 --> 13:47.834
Is that from
Magical Girl Lalako
?

13:48.084 --> 13:50.545
I love it just as much as
Blue Spring
!

13:50.545 --> 13:54.090
Why do you guys always smash
the language barrier at times like this?

13:54.257 --> 13:56.926
We truly love that game!

13:57.427 --> 13:59.888
I could even say
Blue Spring
is my reason for living.

14:00.305 --> 14:02.891
BLUE SPRING!
I know! I completely get it!

14:03.141 --> 14:05.185
So no matter what...

14:05.435 --> 14:07.187
I want her to wear this outfit!!

14:07.437 --> 14:10.315
And let me live in reality!

14:10.899 --> 14:14.944
I also want to see Shiori-chan
in the
Blue Spring
outfit!

14:15.737 --> 14:18.031
Blue Spring
...

14:18.323 --> 14:21.159
As expected,
the only way is to beg on our knees.

14:21.159 --> 14:23.078
Can we really pull this off?

14:23.078 --> 14:25.497
Leave the kneeling ritual to me.

14:25.789 --> 14:27.540
As expected of a fellow brother!

14:27.540 --> 14:29.000
Then let's go!

14:29.000 --> 14:29.709
Okay!

14:29.709 --> 14:30.794
Let's go!

14:30.794 --> 14:32.087
Wait, wait, wait!

14:32.087 --> 14:33.546
Why are you stopping me?

14:33.713 --> 14:37.050
I just tried looking up that game.

14:37.425 --> 14:39.886
UNDER 18 NOT ALLOWED
It's a damn
eroge
!

14:44.057 --> 14:45.558
So what?

14:45.558 --> 14:48.395
How can you guys look at me
with such innocent eyes?

14:48.603 --> 14:51.106
STEPPED ON IN KINDERGARTEN UNIFORM
What the fuck? What the fuck?

14:51.106 --> 14:53.316
What the fuck kind of game is this!?

14:53.316 --> 14:55.777
And you're planning to
recreate scenes from it!?

14:56.319 --> 14:58.363
What on earth are you talking about?

14:58.363 --> 15:00.198
Games are different to real life.

15:00.198 --> 15:01.866
Face the truth, dude.

15:02.117 --> 15:05.662
How could Shiori-chan agree
to do those things?

15:06.538 --> 15:09.416
Think about it. What if
something unexpected happens?

15:09.874 --> 15:12.627
She's a grown woman, too.

15:12.627 --> 15:14.838
You have to trust her judgment.

15:15.463 --> 15:18.800
Besides, this also benefits you.

15:18.800 --> 15:19.801
How so?

15:19.968 --> 15:24.180
While we're distracting her,
you can search her room.

15:25.598 --> 15:28.184
So we split up from here on out.

15:28.435 --> 15:29.727
Let's go!

15:29.727 --> 15:30.478
Alright!

15:30.478 --> 15:32.230
I said stop right there!

15:32.397 --> 15:34.023
Are you going to get in my way?

15:34.232 --> 15:35.358
Of course.

15:35.358 --> 15:36.693
Even if I must use force-

15:36.776 --> 15:38.111
Chopped it in half!

15:40.447 --> 15:42.407
Even if you gotta use force, what?

15:42.740 --> 15:44.576
Never mind.

15:50.498 --> 15:53.001
You can't bring towels into the bath.

15:53.251 --> 15:55.587
This is also a rule
for bathing in hot springs.

15:55.712 --> 15:57.297
That's good to know.

16:00.675 --> 16:02.010
It feels wonderful.

16:02.218 --> 16:03.678
I'm glad to hear that.

16:03.678 --> 16:06.431
It would be even better if it were snowing.

16:06.639 --> 16:09.100
Oh, a snowy scene?

16:09.100 --> 16:11.769
An open-air hot spring
amidst the snow is celestial.

16:11.769 --> 16:13.813
Yes, I'd like to experience it too.

16:14.272 --> 16:17.484
Soaking in the hot water
while it's freezing cold outside.

16:17.484 --> 16:18.651
I'd love that too.

16:20.236 --> 16:21.821
As expected, those two...

16:22.071 --> 16:26.576
without their clothes on, look exactly
like a scene from Blue Spring
.

16:27.410 --> 16:31.873
Hopefully they will also recreate
the subsequent scenes.

16:32.165 --> 16:35.335
Then for some reason,
an octopus appears.

16:35.627 --> 16:38.379
That part is exactly like
something out of a
shunga
.

16:40.423 --> 16:41.508
Karina-san?

16:41.508 --> 16:42.759
Ah, sorry.

16:42.759 --> 16:44.552
It's nothing.

16:44.969 --> 16:47.639
Big Sister Chisa, that look just now...

16:48.181 --> 16:50.099
She completely ignored it!

16:51.142 --> 16:54.354
Could it be she didn't notice
that look just now?

16:54.354 --> 16:55.939
- Chisa-san.
- Huh?

16:55.939 --> 16:57.732
After we're done bathing,

16:58.233 --> 17:01.236
come hang out in my room.

17:01.236 --> 17:03.279
Look at that face, Big Sister Chisa!

17:04.781 --> 17:06.533
Then I'll take you up on that offer.

17:06.533 --> 17:07.575
You're very welcome.

17:07.575 --> 17:09.577
Why is that?

17:09.827 --> 17:12.997
Being looked at with such lustful eyes
yet remaining unfazed.

17:13.331 --> 17:18.294
It's as if she's been used to
that kind of look.

17:24.551 --> 17:26.094
You dropped this.

17:26.386 --> 17:28.096
Thank you.

17:28.429 --> 17:30.223
Why did you bring your passport?

17:30.598 --> 17:33.434
This isn't mine. It's my brother's.

17:33.851 --> 17:35.270
Your brother's?

17:35.645 --> 17:37.522
What do you mean?

17:37.897 --> 17:39.357
It's a bit complicated.

17:39.357 --> 17:41.859
KITAHARA INN

17:41.985 --> 17:43.319
So that's how it is.

17:45.154 --> 17:46.364
How precious!

17:46.364 --> 17:47.407
Precious?

17:47.949 --> 17:50.368
You're jealous, right?

17:50.368 --> 17:52.036
Since you love your bro so much,

17:52.036 --> 17:54.956
when he's ignoring you,
that's why you're angry, right?

17:55.456 --> 17:56.708
Um...

17:56.708 --> 17:58.334
That's not it at all.

17:58.710 --> 17:59.669
I just want to

17:59.669 --> 18:04.507
discipline my brother who doesn't
worry about his own future at all.

18:04.507 --> 18:06.050
So wonderful!

18:06.050 --> 18:09.637
This is true
hentai
culture
in the 3D world!

18:09.721 --> 18:10.763
I can't resist it.

18:10.763 --> 18:12.932
Coming to Japan was the best idea ever.

18:13.266 --> 18:15.310
I told you that's not it.

18:15.476 --> 18:18.896
At this point, she's probably
filtering out everything you say.

18:20.356 --> 18:22.609
Let's hustle back to the room
and continue.

18:22.900 --> 18:23.568
MATSU ROOM

18:23.568 --> 18:24.694
Here it is.

18:28.072 --> 18:30.450
What happened?

18:30.575 --> 18:31.868
Beats me.

18:33.578 --> 18:34.871
Big Brother?

18:35.163 --> 18:37.206
He looks unconscious
but he's on his feet.

18:37.415 --> 18:38.750
Wake up.

18:39.125 --> 18:42.086
What are you doing
in Karina-san's room?

18:42.086 --> 18:43.755
That's strange.

18:43.755 --> 18:45.256
Knowing my brother,

18:45.256 --> 18:49.260
he should be ransacking my room
looking for his passport.

18:49.927 --> 18:53.097
I'm a little curious
to know what happened.

18:53.681 --> 18:56.851
Let me go get a
yukata
replacement
along with some water.

19:02.857 --> 19:04.150
Let's see.

19:04.609 --> 19:08.029
What on earth were they doing?

19:09.155 --> 19:10.948
Are you going to get in my way?

19:10.948 --> 19:12.241
Of course.

19:12.241 --> 19:13.826
Even if I have to use force...

19:13.868 --> 19:16.037
Even if you have to use force, what?

19:16.204 --> 19:18.164
Never mind.

19:18.289 --> 19:20.208
Go right ahead.

19:20.208 --> 19:21.668
Then I won't hold back.

19:21.876 --> 19:23.628
What a pain.

19:24.962 --> 19:27.090
Which scene is your favorite?

19:27.256 --> 19:30.134
Of course the climax scene...

19:34.847 --> 19:37.183
So it's two against one now.

19:37.558 --> 19:39.477
Kitahara, you...

19:39.977 --> 19:41.646
What are you trying to do?

19:41.646 --> 19:44.107
She's always had this habit of...

19:44.107 --> 19:46.609
not saying no
when someone asks for a favor.

19:47.110 --> 19:49.821
If something went sideways,
I'd be freakin' out!

19:49.821 --> 19:51.698
I'm her big brother, damn it!

19:51.698 --> 19:54.659
So I won't let you guys act out
those porn scenes.

19:54.659 --> 19:55.618
Shut up!

19:55.618 --> 19:57.995
Who would believe you!

19:59.956 --> 20:01.874
So that's how it is?

20:06.295 --> 20:07.547
You awful brother.

20:10.967 --> 20:15.763
He planned to guilt-trip me from the start
just to get what he wanted.

20:16.180 --> 20:18.558
And now he's playing
the "good big bro" card?

20:19.684 --> 20:21.436
MATSU ROOM

20:22.061 --> 20:23.646
Is something wrong?

20:24.272 --> 20:25.565
Beats me...

20:25.773 --> 20:26.858
I see.

20:27.316 --> 20:29.569
Did he say that?

20:30.862 --> 20:31.988
Understood.

20:32.613 --> 20:35.908
I will marry him.

20:37.160 --> 20:39.454
M-Marry!?

20:39.454 --> 20:40.538
Yes.

20:40.538 --> 20:43.332
Karina-san,
why bring this up all of a sudden?

20:43.541 --> 20:46.669
I think he's really deep into me.

20:46.961 --> 20:49.964
Since he said that,
I don't have the heart to refuse.

20:49.964 --> 20:51.883
Besides, I really like Japan too.

20:52.008 --> 20:55.344
He seems understanding and will
tolerate my hobbies as an
otaku
.

20:55.344 --> 20:56.637
Fair point.

20:56.637 --> 20:59.056
He's friends with this guy, after all.

20:59.766 --> 21:01.142
And most importantly,

21:01.809 --> 21:04.979
Shiori will become my little sister.

21:05.855 --> 21:07.398
After we get married,

21:07.398 --> 21:11.277
we can try all those
hentai
culture group games.

21:11.277 --> 21:13.738
Um... Karina-san...

21:13.738 --> 21:16.324
You don't even know
my brother very well.

21:16.324 --> 21:18.034
You shouldn't rush into marriage.

21:18.034 --> 21:20.787
It's true that I don't know him well yet.

21:20.787 --> 21:22.705
KITAHARA INN
So I will live

21:22.705 --> 21:24.624
LOVEY-DOVEY ACTION AT THE INN!
with him for a while!

21:25.374 --> 21:28.503
I'll be in Japan
for the whole summer break anyway.

21:28.503 --> 21:30.588
Every day I'll treat him to

21:30.588 --> 21:33.007
some
lucky sukebe
at that rice bowl diner place!

21:33.299 --> 21:37.428
But my brother currently
doesn't live here.

21:37.428 --> 21:39.889
Then I will go to his place.

21:40.389 --> 21:43.726
LIKE
Because I like all the places in Japan.

21:43.810 --> 21:47.355
Of course, Chisa and Shiori
will come along too.

21:47.355 --> 21:49.607
- Everyone will go together.
- Is that so?

21:49.607 --> 21:51.734
Anywhere in Japan is fine?

21:52.026 --> 21:52.985
Eh?

21:53.277 --> 21:55.655
Oh, what are you all doing here?

21:55.863 --> 21:57.615
Oh! Darling...

21:57.865 --> 21:58.908
Big Brother.

21:59.075 --> 21:59.951
Yeah?

22:00.368 --> 22:02.578
Have a blast in Palau.

22:03.246 --> 22:03.788
Huh?

22:08.209 --> 22:10.920
Why'd she suddenly give it back?

22:11.254 --> 22:12.672
Who knows.

22:19.637 --> 22:21.264
3... 2... 1... Go!

22:30.815 --> 22:33.568
A sweet little love story!?

22:33.568 --> 22:36.320
Asymmetrical reflection in the mirror

22:36.320 --> 22:37.947
A shattered, crunchy heart

22:37.947 --> 22:39.991
Oh oh, stumbling around

22:40.575 --> 22:42.994
Oh oh, just acting on instinct

22:42.994 --> 22:46.956
Diving deep into my subconscious

22:46.956 --> 22:48.708
Tumbling and falling down

22:48.708 --> 22:51.294
A limit-breaking paradise

22:51.294 --> 22:52.545
Viva, cheers

22:52.545 --> 22:54.005
Everyone, cheers

22:54.005 --> 22:56.048
We're in trouble, we're in trouble

22:56.048 --> 22:56.757
Big trouble

22:56.757 --> 22:58.759
We're in trouble, we're in trouble

22:58.759 --> 22:59.594
Wa wa wa

22:59.594 --> 23:01.554
We're in trouble, we're in trouble

23:01.554 --> 23:02.263
Wa wa wa wa

23:02.263 --> 23:04.223
Let's go, everybody

23:04.223 --> 23:07.685
Dramatic just like a rainbow

23:07.685 --> 23:10.688
Your troubled smile
is absolutely priceless

23:10.688 --> 23:15.985
Total chaos
getting kissed by an octopus

23:15.985 --> 23:18.738
A mermaid washed up on the shore

23:18.738 --> 23:21.657
Darling drowned down
in the Dragon Palace

23:21.657 --> 23:26.954
The treasure box is just full of alcohol

23:26.954 --> 23:29.665
The ultimate license of our youth

23:29.665 --> 23:32.627
Find the treasure and checkmate

23:32.627 --> 23:37.840
An angel who overslept
from swimming too much

23:37.840 --> 23:39.300
Let's go, everybody

23:39.300 --> 23:40.676
Viva, cheers

23:40.676 --> 23:42.011
Oh yeah

23:42.011 --> 23:43.679
Viva, cheers
